  (text "ratatouille: cooking-coach wearable, power-bank build" (at 20.32 25.4 0) (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54)) (justify left top)) (uuid "574b7a19-71e2-507b-9244-d750f19cc682"))
  (text "Generated by gen_kicad.py. Edit the script, not this sheet, or your edits get overwritten." (at 20.32 30.48 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "8a25242d-bdd0-5dd3-b000-932e618eef14"))
  (text "J1 CC1/CC2: 5.1k to GND on the board\n(add 2 if missing). D+/D-: unused." (at 20.32 63.5 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "6d9ab139-b64f-59e0-8b69-cef79496f707"))
  (text "POWER\n- J1: red 6-pin USB-C board, header into the perfboard.\n  Cable: USB-A (bank's A port, plain 5 V) to USB-C.\n  Never use a 9/12 V USB-PD trigger board.\n- JP1 fitted (normal): the servos run off the bank.\n- Backup if the boards brown out: REMOVE JP1,\n  then plug a 4.8 V NiMH pack into J6.\n  Never fit JP1 with J6 plugged in.\n- All grounds are common.\n- Unplug J1 before plugging a USB cable into\n  either board to flash it." (at 20.32 111.76 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "71367ea6-3b4d-5d4e-9133-bba1c29b5bfd"))
  (text "camera: Wi-Fi only, no signal wires" (at 99.06 60.96 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "3bd36a27-e82e-5c6b-b35d-0555e49a4b65"))
  (text "Do not use GPIO 35-37 (octal PSRAM)." (at 99.06 119.38 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "c280420d-f624-5fe7-bf71-952cebe4caf5"))
  (text "C1 and C3 sit physically at the servo plugs,\nnot back at the battery. Striped leg of C1 = GND." (at 160.02 33.02 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "508a07fe-1663-5bb8-8fed-a248ec3152d2"))
  (text "LASER\n- Q1 switches the laser's low side.\n- R2 holds the base low, so the laser stays off while the S3 boots.\n- Most TO-92 2N2222A are E-B-C (flat face toward you, legs down).\n  Check yours.\n- Firmware turns the laser off 0.5 s after UDP packets stop." (at 99.06 132.08 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "8fd6b510-6dbc-525f-b63b-0df45648325d"))
  (text "TFT: SCL/SDA on the module are really SPI clock/data (SCK/MOSI).\nPower it from 3V3. Modules without a CS pin: leave TFT_CS unconnected." (at 160.02 182.88 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "38b276ec-7b53-5e32-8800-64f8e9f0b4f6"))
